# Normalise text to LF in the repository, whatever the contributor's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The sample resume is a byte-exact PDF: its cross-reference table stores
# absolute byte offsets. Letting git rewrite its line endings shifts every
# offset and corrupts the file on checkout, which breaks the PDF fixture and
# the demo for anyone who clones on Windows. Keep it binary.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
